Rips_SetFeeRecipient
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert.
└── when the caller is the owner
    ├── when the new recipient is the zero address
    │   └── it should revert.
    └── when the new recipient is not the zero address
        ├── it should update the fee recipient.
        └── it should emit a {FeeRecipientUpdated} event.
